     "set": {
      "fill": "danger",
      "tone": "danger"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "lab",
     "set": {
      "text": "5 + 4 → −7 ✗"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Start at 1010 = −6 and add −3: three steps anticlockwise cross the seam backwards to 0111 = +7. The true sum −9 is below −8. Overflow again.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "n5",
     "set": {
      "fill": "none",
      "tone": "ink"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n9",
     "set": {
      "fill": "none",
      "tone": "ink"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "path",
     "set": {
      "start": 157.5,
      "end": 225.0
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "ptr",
     "set": {
      "to": "n7"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n7",
     "set": {
      "fill": "danger",
      "tone": "danger"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "lab",
     "set": {
      "text": "−6 + (−3) → +7 ✗"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Now 0101 (+5) + 1101 (−3). As unsigned steps that is 13 clockwise, which lands in the same place as 3 steps back (13 = 16 − 3): 0010 = +2. The band shows the short way round. The 13-step route only passes 0000 (a carry out of 4 bits, dropped); the seam is not crossed, so +2 is right.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "n7",
     "set": {
      "fill": "none",
      "tone": "ink"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "path",
     "set": {
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 112.5
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "ptr",
     "set": {
      "to": "n2"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "n2",
     "set": {
      "fill": "success",
      "tone": "success"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "lab",
     "set": {
      "text": "5 + (−3) → +2 ✓"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Rule: a sum overflows exactly when it crosses the +7 / −8 seam. That can only happen when both operands have the same sign. (Chapter 5 turns this into a gate: carry into the sign bit ≠ carry out of it.)",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "path",
     "set": {
      "hidden": true
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "lab",
     "set": {
      "text": "overflow = crossing the seam"
     }
    }
   ]
  }
